- * candidate observes: 0x10b000 (display), 0x33000 (PDM), 0x43000 (XO/4),
- * 0x62000 (debug mux). */
+ * candidate observes: 0x10b000 (display), 0x133000 (PDM), 0x143000 (XO/4),
